[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10200.87, "timestamp": "02:50:00", "text": "我排名第一。在树顶上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10204.55, "timestamp": "02:50:04", "text": "哦，在水里。我的天哪。在水中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10207.429, "timestamp": "02:50:07", "text": "我在水里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10211.349, "timestamp": "02:50:11", "text": "在水里。是的。哦，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10215.75, "timestamp": "02:50:15", "text": "很棒的平台游戏。 Kosan是什么时候生产的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10218.71, "timestamp": "02:50:18", "text": "这？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10226.95, "timestamp": "02:50:26", "text": "等等，这里是我们的基地，对吧？顶部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10231.59, "timestamp": "02:50:31", "text": "基地、储物空间，所有的一切。它可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10235.11, "timestamp": "02:50:35", "text": "从这里访问。哇。我可以跳吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10239.59, "timestamp": "02:50:39", "text": "如果我跳下去会发生什么？不，我会死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10242.23, "timestamp": "02:50:42", "text": "我真的在最顶端"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10244.79, "timestamp": "02:50:44", "text": "树，对吧？我来了。是的，你在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10247.59, "timestamp": "02:50:47", "text": "是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10255.91, "timestamp": "02:50:55", "text": "是的。有时候我没注意到，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10257.59, "timestamp": "02:50:57", "text": "非常大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10259.99, "timestamp": "02:50:59", "text": "是的，这意义重大。"}]